ISO-10303-21;
/* Tsh089: ADVANCED_FACE IS wired with 1 FACE_OUTER_BOUND (200x200 outer loop); FACE_BOUND 1 IS wired as 5x5mm internal hole at (10,10) — IS mechanism; FACE_BOUND 2 IS wired as 10x10mm internal hole at (30,30) — IS mechanism; both inner FACE_BOUNDs ARE directly embedded in ADVANCED_FACE topology; small-hole area vs large face area IS the tolerance-threshold mechanism; ShapeUpgrade_RemoveInternalWires.Perform uses fixed absolute threshold; skips small wires on large face; fix: use face-area-relative threshold; emit E_INTERNAL_WIRE_PRESERVED when wire area < 0.1% of face area */
